senses.gloss:
एध् cl. 1. Ā. ए॑धते (rarely P. -ति), एधां-चक्रे, एधिता, एधिष्यते, ऐधिष्ट, to prosper, increase, become happy, grow strong, RV.; AV.; VS.; ŚBr.; Mn.;
to grow big with self-importance, become insolent;
to become intense, extend, spread, gain ground (as fire or passions), MBh.; BhP.;
to swell, rise (as waters), BhP. :
Caus. एधयति, to cause to prosper or increase, wish for the welfare or happiness (of any one), bless, BhP.; Kum. vi, 90; Bhaṭṭ.
